    "Defender Rally",
    "2 July 2026",
    "Goodwood Festival of Speed visitors enjoy preview of forthcoming Range Rover Electric ahead of full reveal later in 2026",
    "Dedicated Range Rover gallery to showcase exclusive London Editions – Westminster, Battersea, Belgravia and Hoxton – alongside a collection of flagship models",
    "Range Rover Sport SV Ultimate Edition takes to the Goodwood hillclimb in a display of dynamic performance",
    "Goodwood, UK – Thursday 2 July 2026: Range Rover returns to Goodwood Festival of Speed on 9‑12 July 2026 with a public preview of its highly anticipated electric SUV alongside a line‑up of exclusive editions and high‑performance models.",
    "Taking prominence within the Range Rover gallery, Range Rover Electric is presented in production specification ahead of its full global reveal later this year, offering visitors their closest look yet at the brand’s next chapter. Set within a calm, contemporary space, the preview embodies Range Rover’s direction of refined electric capability.",
    "This landmark appearance underlines the brand’s commitment to effortless performance, peerless refinement and all‑terrain confidence in an electric form, maintaining the defining qualities that have shaped Range Rover for more than five decades.",
    "Alongside Range Rover Electric, a portfolio of models showcases the new Range Rover London Editions, inspired by the character and cultural identity of the UK capital. Westminster, Battersea, Belgravia and Hoxton each interpret a distinct facet of London life through bespoke design details, materials and finishes, reinforcing the brand’s focus on personalisation and contemporary luxury – a sensibility that carries through a number of Range Rover’s appearances across the British summer season, in a selected programme of events that reflect the same interplay of culture, design and performance.",
    "On the iconic Goodwood hillclimb, Range Rover Sport SV Ultimate Edition will tackle the course in a dynamic demonstration of its performance and capability on all four days of the festival.",
    "Goodwood Festival of Speed provides the perfect stage to showcase the next chapter of Range Rover. From the first public preview of a production‑spec Range Rover Electric to our exclusive London Editions and SV models, this year’s line‑up reflects how we are redefining modern luxury for an electrified era.",
    "Goodwood Festival of Speed provides the perfect stage to showcase the next chapter of Range Rover. From the first public preview of a production‑spec Range Rover Electric to our exclusive London Editions and SV models, this year’s line‑up reflects how we are redefining modern luxury for an electrified era.",
    "SOCIAL CHANNELS",
    "TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@rangerover Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/rangerover Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/rangerover YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@rangerover",
    "ABOUT RANGE ROVER",
    "Every Range Rover is curated for our clients – people who move with purpose, vision and integrity. With modernist design, serene and connected interiors, and effortlessly capable electrified performance, each vehicle offers a calm sanctuary that supports leadership in motion. Inspired by exemplary design since 1970.",
    "The Range Rover family includes Range Rover, Range Rover Sport, Range Rover Velar and Range Rover Evoque. As part of our vision of modern luxury by design, every Range Rover is available as an electric hybrid, with fully electric models arriving before 2030.",
    "Range Rover is one of the world’s leading British luxury brands, sold in 121 countries. It forms part of JLR's portfolio of distinctive British brands.",
    "IMPORTANT NOTICE",
