    "body": [
      "Goodwood, UK – Thursday 2 July 2026: Range Rover returns to Goodwood Festival of Speed on 9‑12 July 2026 with a public preview of its highly anticipated electric SUV alongside a line‑up of exclusive editions and high‑performance models.",
      "Taking prominence within the Range Rover gallery, Range Rover Electric is presented in production specification ahead of its full global reveal later this year, offering visitors their closest look yet at the brand’s next chapter. Set within a calm, contemporary space, the preview embodies Range Rover’s direction of refined electric capability.",
      "This landmark appearance underlines the brand’s commitment to effortless performance, peerless refinement and all‑terrain confidence in an electric form, maintaining the defining qualities that have shaped Range Rover for more than five decades.",
      "Alongside Range Rover Electric, a portfolio of models showcases the new Range Rover London Editions, inspired by the character and cultural identity of the UK capital. Westminster, Battersea, Belgravia and Hoxton each interpret a distinct facet of London life through bespoke design details, materials and finishes, reinforcing the brand’s focus on personalisation and contemporary luxury – a sensibility that carries through a number of Range Rover’s appearances across the British summer season, in a selected programme of events that reflect the same interplay of culture, design and performance.",
      "On the iconic Goodwood hillclimb, Range Rover Sport SV Ultimate Edition will tackle the course in a dynamic demonstration of its performance and capability on all four days of the festival."
    ],
